## Important Disclaimer

This is an illustrative portfolio project developed using sample warehouse data.

The AI agent provides analytical insights and decision-support recommendations only. It does not connect to a live WMS environment, create actual replenishment tasks or execute warehouse transactions.

Forecasting results are based on the project's sample dataset and should not be interpreted as production-level accuracy.

